commit c58df01b
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 14:51:35 -0600
subject: feat(combos+models): combo duplicate, dev flag, model chooser sorting, capability overrides, model import for all providers

- feat(combos): Duplicate button on combo cards (copy all models + kind)
- feat(settings): devMode flag in settings defaults + profile page toggle
- feat(combos): Create Combo from provider detail page (dev-mode gated)
- feat(models): Connected providers sorted first in ModelSelectModal
- feat(models): Provider-name search in model chooser (searching 'openrouter' shows all openrouter models)
- feat(models): Per-model capability overrides (vision/audio) via settings.modelCapOverrides
- feat(models): mergeUserCapabilityOverrides in capabilities.js
- feat(api): /api/models merges user capability overrides from settings
- feat(hooks): useModelCaps resolves audioInput capability
- modelRow: Vision/Audio toggle buttons for capability editing
- Plan doc: 2026-08-18-dev-flag-combo-from-providers-model-sorting.md


